WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium punch connects at close range.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.550
Crouching medium punch connects after the first Drive Rush cancel.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.350
Back heavy punch connects before the second Drive Rush cancel.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.750
The second Rush crouching medium punch connects with Manon in burnout.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.800
Back medium kick starts its two-kick target combo.

6
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.150
Light Rond-point juggles Ryu before the super cancel.

7
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:14.750
Pas de Deux connects after the light Rond-point cancel.

8
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:15.000
The level-3 animation finishes with Ryu knocked down and Manon still in burnout.
